; An include, pushtag or popmeta followed by another word is a syntax error,
; and the line is dropped: the file is not included, the tag not pushed and
; the metadata not popped, so the popmeta after it still has a key to pop.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A

include "other.beancount" "extra"
2020-01-02 open Assets:B

pushtag #t extra
2020-01-03 open Assets:C

pushmeta kk: "1"
popmeta kk: extra
2020-01-04 open Assets:D
popmeta kk:
